WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:08.240
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain a Sci-Fi Drama film called “The Day Of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.240 --> 00:00:20.240
The Triffids”. Watch out and take care!
Dr. Bill Masen is a biotech engineer at a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:26.800
research company called Triffoil. He specializes&nbsp;
in a tall, carnivorous plant called the Triffids.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:32.160
The plant contains an oil that is an alternative&nbsp;
to fossil fuel. Over the past thirty years,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:38.080
Triffids have become man’s best friend and have&nbsp;
helped eradicate global warming. But, many do not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:44.720
know that the carnivorous plant is a real danger&nbsp;
to humans if left unattended. Thirty years ago,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:50.560
Masen’s mother, who was also a researcher,&nbsp;
was killed by a Triffid. Masen knows that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:56.400
if necessary, Triffids will feed on humans. Its&nbsp;
branches are extremely venomous that can blind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:02.000
a person in only seconds. The breeding of the&nbsp;
plant is licensed and done away from cities.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:07.200
When a plant shows an abnormality, Masen is&nbsp;
called to check on it. While he is at it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:13.360
the branches grip his arm and his associate has&nbsp;
to tase them away. Meanwhile, an anti Triffoil&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:19.200
activist breaches the premises and enters the&nbsp;
Orchard where all the male Triffids are kept.
&nbsp;

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:24.080
The security cameras alert the officials&nbsp;
who send backup to get the man out safely.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:29.680
Masen and his colleague Lucy run to the&nbsp;
Orchard and try to calm the man. Suddenly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:35.520
a Triffid branch attacks Masen’s eyes but misses&nbsp;
it. The backup arrives and gets everyone out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:41.440
safely whereas Masen is poisoned by the minor&nbsp;
cut. Lucy rushes him to the hospital in London.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:46.560
After giving Masen an antivenom, the doctor&nbsp;
bandages his eyes and asks him to rest for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:51.760
twenty-four hours. In the meantime, the entire&nbsp;
world is waiting for a meteor shower that is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:58.400
about to take place at night. A reporter named Joe&nbsp;
Clayton interviews an astrophysicist. According&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:05.520
to him, the sun will release an unbelievably vast&nbsp;
explosion of gas and nuclear fire, making it seem&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:11.200
like fireworks in the sky. Yet, it is proven&nbsp;
that the fireworks won’t do any harm to humans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:16.800
or the earth. He asks the public to enjoy the&nbsp;
once in the lifetime experience to their best.
&nbsp;

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:22.800
A few hours later, when it gets dark in London,&nbsp;
the fireworks start. Joe broadcasts it live from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:28.400
the heart of London. Everyone in the world&nbsp;
watches the burning sky in awe. Lucy feels&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.400 --> 00:02:33.760
bad for Masen that he couldn’t experience such&nbsp;
a unique phenomenon. Passengers of an airplane&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:39.440
flying above London also witness the fireworks&nbsp;
and are mesmerized by them. Among the passengers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:45.200
is a man named Torrance who doesn’t appear to care&nbsp;
about the natural fireworks. He simply sleeps with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:50.880
an eye mask while others get up from their seats&nbsp;
to look outside. A few minutes into the fireworks,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:57.120
a blinding bright light flashes on the earth.&nbsp;
Because of it, all the TVs and radios lose signal.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.120 --> 00:03:02.400
The light is so bright that people can hardly keep&nbsp;
their eyes open. A while after everything ends,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:08.320
Masen wakes up on the hospital bed, with his eyes&nbsp;
still bandaged. Outside, everyone is panicking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:08.320 --> 00:03:13.520
because the light has caused all of them to&nbsp;
lose their eyesight. A confused Masen opens the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:19.600
bandages from his eyes and can see clearly. Back&nbsp;
in the airplane, Torrance wakes up and realizes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:25.280
what is going on. The plan is about to crash&nbsp;
because even the pilots have also gone blind. 
&nbsp;

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:30.560
Amidst the chaos, he collects all the life&nbsp;
jackets, blows them up, and uses them to keep&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:36.720
himself safe in the bathroom. The plane crashes&nbsp;
near a hospital in London. All passengers die in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:42.240
the crash but Torrance somehow survives with only&nbsp;
minor injuries. After coming out of the wreckage,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:46.880
he smiles at the victory, not showing&nbsp;
any remorse at the death of the others.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.880 --> 00:03:52.560
Meanwhile, Masen tries to find the doctor in the&nbsp;
crowd but even the doctor is blind and has no idea&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:57.520
what is going on. When he registers that there&nbsp;
is going to be a power outage soon, he runs back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:02.400
to the lab to keep the Triffids confined.&nbsp;
If the plants get out of the lab somehow,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:08.960
they will breed at an exponential rate and kill&nbsp;
everyone on earth. Somewhere else, the reporter&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:14.240
Joe Clayton wakes up in the middle of the ruins&nbsp;
of a building. Unlike most, she still has her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:19.760
eyesight. Joe makes it to the streets and realizes&nbsp;
what is going on. She tries asking for help but a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:25.440
blind policeman holds her hostage, urging her&nbsp;
to take him home. Before he can do any harm,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.440 --> 00:04:31.120
Masen saves her. They plan to go to the Whitehall&nbsp;
together to find out what exactly is going on. 
&nbsp;

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:36.880
Somewhere else, Torrance takes full advantage of&nbsp;
the situation and steals everything he can from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:41.840
the stores. He also takes a policeman’s gun&nbsp;
for protection and makes his way to a hotel.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:46.800
Back on the Triffid farm, everyone,&nbsp;
including Lucy, has lost their eyesight.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:52.320
The activist who was confined in a room, however,&nbsp;
can still see. Taking advantage of the situation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:57.040
he opens the doors to the orchard and&nbsp;
lets the Triffids free. The next morning,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:57.040 --> 00:05:02.320
Joe and Masen reach Whitehall but see that a&nbsp;
crowd of blind people has gathered in front of it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:07.280
They try communicating with the blind guards&nbsp;
who start to shoot each other. Following that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:12.640
the two drive to the Triffid farm. When they reach&nbsp;
there, the lab is in ruins with dead bodies of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:18.080
the workers lying everywhere. Masen finally&nbsp;
registers the seriousness of the situation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:22.960
now that the Triffids have escaped. They go to&nbsp;
his lab and retrieve a recorder that contains&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:28.080
the Triffid’s noise. Masen has been recording the&nbsp;
noise over the years and has theorized that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:32.720
plants are communicating with each other. 
Following that, they drive to Joe’s father's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:38.000
house to make sure he is safe. However,&nbsp;
when they reach there, he has already been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:42.640
killed and is being pulled away by the&nbsp;
branches of Triffid. With no way out,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:48.560
the duo goes to a radio station and broadcasts the&nbsp;
news about the dangerous plant. They warn all the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:54.000
listeners with sight to help the others get to&nbsp;
a safe place. Somewhere else, Torrance reaches&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:59.360
the current prime minister’s office and asks his&nbsp;
secretary about his whereabouts. After finding out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:04.400
that the government has collapsed, he sets off&nbsp;
to look for weapons, aiming to be the people’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:09.680
next leader. In the morning, Masen sees flare&nbsp;
signals coming from the other part of the city.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:14.400
He realizes that there are more people like them&nbsp;
and who have probably formed a community. 
&nbsp;

00:06:14.400 --> 00:06:18.480
When the duo finally reaches the building where&nbsp;
all the survivors have gathered, they see that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:23.440
the officials are not allowing blind people to&nbsp;
enter the premises. They are received by Michelle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:29.280
Beadley, an employee of the home office and the&nbsp;
chief of the survivor’s organization. Currently,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:34.800
the organization is working on providing food and&nbsp;
shelter to the affected people but is oblivious&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:40.400
to the problem of Triffids. When Masen tells them&nbsp;
about the real danger, Michelle asks him for his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:45.680
expert advice. A clip shows us that the plants&nbsp;
have taken over the railway tracks and will soon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:50.320
be in the streets of London. Michelle wants to&nbsp;
bring the little community of the sighted people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:50.320 --> 00:06:57.280
to a safe place and start anew, leaving the blind&nbsp;
to die. Masen and Joe do not support her idea&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.280 --> 00:07:02.560
so they decide not to work with her. Out&nbsp;
in the streets, a sighted man named Coker&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.560 --> 00:07:07.920
is gathering the blind people and is organizing&nbsp;
a search party for food and water to help them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.920 --> 00:07:13.280
He has become the leader of the group. Torrance&nbsp;
sees that Coker is in power and asks to join&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:18.320
his team. They plan to raid the building with&nbsp;
sighted people to hold them hostage and force&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:24.320
them to help the blind. Meanwhile, Masen plans to&nbsp;
go to his father who lives in the countryside. His&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.320 --> 00:07:30.160
father is also a bio engineer and a researcher on&nbsp;
Triffids. Masen believes that with his research,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:36.400
they can find a way to contain the plants. 
However, before they leave, they are attacked by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.400 --> 00:07:42.560
Coker and his group and are taken hostage. Coker&nbsp;
handcuffs each sighted person to a blind one and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:47.760
gives them the responsibility to help them. His&nbsp;
heart is in the right place but he is oblivious&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:53.040
to the dangers of the Triffids. Following that,&nbsp;
they are taken to a warehouse to collect food and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:58.800
supplies. But trouble arises when the warehouse&nbsp;
happens to be infested by Triffids. Joe is caught&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:03.680
in one of the branches but Masen saves her.&nbsp;
Coker realizes that Masen was right about the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:08.960
Triffids. He asks Torrance to provide Masen with&nbsp;
everything he needs to get rid of the problem. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:14.880
since Torrance wants to be the leader, he plans&nbsp;
to betray Coker. When Joe is alone, he asks her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.880 --> 00:08:20.880
to broadcast another message on the radio asking&nbsp;
everyone to come to London for aid. In reality, he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:26.960
wants to gather as many people as possible to rule&nbsp;
over them. Unknown to his true motives, she agrees&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:26.960 --> 00:08:33.200
to do as he says. Meanwhile, his people take Coker&nbsp;
and Masen hostage, kicking them out of authority.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:37.920
They are taken to a forest by Torrance’s&nbsp;
henchmen but are soon attacked by Triffids. 
&nbsp;

00:08:37.920 --> 00:08:43.200
The plants kill all of Torrance’s men, and only&nbsp;
Masen and Coker come out of the forest alive.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:48.080
The next morning, they reach a nearby church&nbsp;
where Masen is treated for his injuries.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:52.880
The church is run by the head nun who claims&nbsp;
that they are immune to Triffid attacks.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:56.960
Masen believes there is something she&nbsp;
is hiding. When Masen gets better,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:56.960 --> 00:09:02.960
he leaves to look for his father’s place while&nbsp;
Coker stays back in the Church. On his way, Masen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:09.440
sees several bodies of nuns placed on crosses set&nbsp;
as a sacrifice to keep Triffids away. It turns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:14.480
out that the head nun has been sacrificing people&nbsp;
to keep the church safe. He returns to the church&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:14.480 --> 00:09:20.240
and reveals the truth to its people. They kick the&nbsp;
nun out of the place and thank Masen for his help.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:25.840
Following that, he continues the journey to his&nbsp;
father’s house which is still a mile away. 
&nbsp;

00:09:25.840 --> 00:09:30.880
In the meantime, Joe finds Masen’s tape&nbsp;
recorder that was found in an attack zone.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:36.080
She realizes that Torrance has done something to&nbsp;
Coker and Masen to become the leader. In her next&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:41.360
radio broadcast, she tells the people that London&nbsp;
is not safer than the place they already live in,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:47.520
hence they should stay put wherever they are. This&nbsp;
angers Torrance and he sends his men to kill her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:52.640
Joe manages to somehow escape the radio tower&nbsp;
and runs to the infested part of the city. The&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:57.520
henchmen try to catch her but are unsuccessful.&nbsp;
They believe that she can never survive among&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:57.520 --> 00:10:03.040
the Triffids and quit looking for her. Joe is&nbsp;
attacked by an army of the plants but luckily,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:08.880
she finds a working vehicle and drives away.&nbsp;
She is also driving to Masen’s father’s place,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:14.800
having known where he lives. Meanwhile, Masen&nbsp;
reaches a small town where everyone has died&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:14.800 --> 00:10:20.720
because of a Triffid attack except for two&nbsp;
little girls named Susan and Imogen. At first,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:25.840
they fire at him, believing he is a robber but&nbsp;
stop when Masen explains he just needs a vehicle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.840 --> 00:10:30.480
to drive to his father’s place. The girls have&nbsp;
been living on their own since their parents died&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:36.000
and need an adult to take care of them. Masen&nbsp;
includes them in the mission and the three set&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:36.000 --> 00:10:40.800
out to look for his father. After driving for&nbsp;
a few hours, they are stopped by a vehicle.
&nbsp;

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:46.240
Coincidently, Masen’s father gets out of the&nbsp;
vehicle and asks them to join him. They drive&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:52.160
to his house in the middle of the woods that&nbsp;
is fenced with electrocuted wires. On going in,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:58.320
Masen is shocked to see Joe. The two reunite,&nbsp;
relieved that they are alive. For a few minutes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:03.600
they forget the troubles of the outside world&nbsp;
and slow dance together. Back in London, Torrance&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:08.560
is tense because he has no means to save the&nbsp;
people he has gathered. He knows the only person&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:14.240
who can stop the plants is Masen. Meanwhile,&nbsp;
Masen’s father already has an elaborate plan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:19.680
to get rid of the Triffids. He has been breeding&nbsp;
a female Triffid that is genetically modified to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:24.800
sterilize the pollen from a male Triffid. If&nbsp;
these kinds of Triffids are spread all around,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:30.080
they will make the entire population infertile,&nbsp;
and eventually, all of them will die out.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:35.200
But he needs the pollen from a male Triffid for&nbsp;
the experiment to be completed. Masen sets out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:35.200 --> 00:11:41.040
to hunt a male Triffid and Susan comes with him.&nbsp;
They are in a warehouse trying to find one. Masen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:41.040 --> 00:11:45.760
uses his mother’s recordings of the Triffid&nbsp;
noise to attract the plant. Susan is attacked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:45.760 --> 00:11:51.360
by the plant that almost pulls her away before&nbsp;
Masen jumps on it and hits it repeatedly.
&nbsp;

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:56.320
They bring its branch back to the house and start&nbsp;
the experiment. That night, Torrance gets his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:56.320 --> 00:12:01.760
hands on Masen’s report and finds out his father’s&nbsp;
address. They quickly leave for the countryside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:07.440
to get them. Back in the house, a helicopter&nbsp;
flies above, distributing pamphlets everywhere.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:12.720
Through the pamphlets, the group is informed about&nbsp;
a survivor’s colony in Isle of Wight where people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:12.720 --> 00:12:17.600
are providing food and water to everyone. After&nbsp;
defeating the Triffids, Masen and the group plan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:22.720
to move there. His father is feeding the female&nbsp;
Triffid as usual, but this time, he listens to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:28.080
Triffid voice recording while doing so. The noise&nbsp;
makes the Triffid aggressive and it attacks the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:34.240
old man. Masen comes to save his father and shoots&nbsp;
the Triffid dead. But it is too late because he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:34.240 --> 00:12:40.480
is already poisoned by the plant’s sting. Now,&nbsp;
since the plant is dead, they have no way to fight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:45.760
against the Triffids. They cremate his father’s&nbsp;
dead body at night and decide to leave for Isle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:45.760 --> 00:12:51.200
of wight the next morning. While going through the&nbsp;
old stuff at the house, Masen finds a black mask&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:56.400
that he remembers wearing the day his mother died.&nbsp;
He doesn’t remember much about the day but he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:56.400 --> 00:13:02.160
knows that he was saved by a trivial group in an&nbsp;
African jungle who knew how to fight Triffids. 
&nbsp;

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:08.560
The next morning, Torrance and his men arrive at&nbsp;
the house and take everyone hostage. He asks Masen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:08.560 --> 00:13:14.960
for a way to fight the Triffids but even he has no&nbsp;
ideas left. An enraged Torrance orders him to come&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:14.960 --> 00:13:20.480
up with a plan one way or the other, or he will&nbsp;
kill the girls. Masen knows there is no way to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:25.840
stop the Triffids now. Instead, he prioritizes&nbsp;
getting everyone out of the house safely.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:30.480
For that, he plans to use the Triffid recordings&nbsp;
to attract the plants. When Torrance and his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:34.720
people are busy fighting them, the group&nbsp;
will have a chance to escape. That night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:40.720
the house is surrounded by Triffids as Masen had&nbsp;
planned. Torrance realizes that Masen was behind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:46.960
all this and asks his right-hand man Troy to kill&nbsp;
the girls. Troy, however, has had enough of his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:52.320
boss and doesn’t want to kill the little girls.&nbsp;
He sides with Masen and the team and protects&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:57.920
them. Soon, the Triffids take over them and kill&nbsp;
all of Torrance’s people. The others try to run&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:03.280
away but since the house is surrounded, they are&nbsp;
trapped. In the moment of panic, Masen remembers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:08.560
the day his mother died. A man from the trivial&nbsp;
group had made Masen wear the mask and poured&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:13.520
Triffid venom around his eyes. The venom tricked&nbsp;
the plants into thinking he was one of them.
&nbsp;

00:14:13.520 --> 00:14:18.400
He does the same with everyone and carefully&nbsp;
steps outside the house. Low and behold,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:24.160
the plants do not attack the group. Just then,&nbsp;
Torrance comes outside and starts firing at them.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:30.480
He is caught in Triffid branches and killed while&nbsp;
the group escapes safely. In the last scene,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:30.480 --> 00:14:35.920
they are on their way to the isle of wight to&nbsp;
start a new life and fight the Triffids with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:39.520
the knowledge they have gathered. 
